## Limitations and Future Improvements

Although this run achieved 100% cross-validation and test accuracy, these results should be interpreted cautiously. Perfect scores do not necessarily mean the model will generalize to unseen real-world data.

Potential improvements include:

- Verifying the source and reliability of the dataset labels.
- Moving all data-dependent preprocessing, including age imputation and fare/age binning, inside a cross-validated preprocessing pipeline to reduce data leakage.
- Comparing KNN with Logistic Regression, Decision Trees, and Random Forests.
- Evaluating performance on an independent dataset.
- Recording and comparing metrics across multiple random splits.

